# Amonkhet Raceway on the other side: Max speed is about its controller's own speed (CR 702.178a, 702.179), which is
# tracked per player. Bot2 plays its own Amonkhet Raceway on turn 2 and has speed 1 (CR 702.179a) while Bot1, with a
# Raceway of its own and three Lightning Bolts, reaches speed 4 on turn 5. Bot2's land is untapped and a Memnite is there
# to receive haste, but Bot2's land does not have Bot1's max-speed ability: only its mana ability works.

[Bot1 Deck]
Amonkhet Raceway
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Amonkhet Raceway
Memnite
Island x18

